> node --test dist-test/tests/unit/*.test.js

✔ EN/ZH narrow modal frames have exact widths and visible semantic controls for all tabs (23.203221ms)
✔ render and input are pure; visible receipt acknowledges only rendered rows and preserves arrivals (3.130407ms)
✔ Find handles printable raw mapped command keys, Unicode, paste, deletion, arrows and Enter (2.916194ms)
✔ keyboard/mouse action target IDs match selected rows; snooze duration uses frame time (1.04701ms)
✔ history opens frozen observed state and Escape returns to snapshots before closing (0.725949ms)
✔ external names/model summaries and paths cannot emit terminal escape sequences (0.603601ms)
✔ unknown data displays absence labels, paused model summary availability is explicit, tiny layouts do not overflow (0.726871ms)
✔ Sessions lists this directory's recent sessions with the command that resumes one, whole, and runs nothing (12.270672ms)
✔ restart dedup, terminal completion, per-event read/snooze and recovery (115.090826ms)
✔ a captured receipt cannot hide later arrivals, even after restart or out-of-order acknowledgements (54.564904ms)
✔ concurrent panels merge action state and no-op quiet ticks do not rewrite storage (23.277535ms)
✔ live lock defers pending actions and dead-owner lock is recovered without dropping them (25.344821ms)
✔ Git and changed stored model summaries record observations without raw reports or guessed clean states (255.467704ms)
✔ missing evidence cannot resolve alerts, explicit health recovery and later mismatch create new occurrences (1.315995ms)
✔ history replays bounded agent state, search name/role/path and pins survive restart (43.761721ms)
✔ bounds limit persisted history, events, metadata text and ages; session root is scoped safely (1458.604362ms)
✔ malformed/oversized files are ignored; view snapshots are immutable copies with no file reads (20.899395ms)
✔ unknown agent/native state and main read success cannot claim unrelated Git recovery (1.401976ms)
✔ serialized storage remains readable within its byte limit at worst-case metadata sizes (3306.234893ms)
✔ an unresolved current condition survives retention and a delayed old panel cannot resolve a newer failure (6.16438ms)
✔ explicit collector recovery survives old retained lastError records and newer failures still alert (10.468399ms)
✔ an existing success watermark crossing a retained failure recovers without quiet timestamp churn (7.953029ms)
✔ stale nested or explicitly passed trees cannot resolve a newer shared agent failure (5.531589ms)
✔ a new root never journals an old log after a failed scan or a retained stale display (3.758155ms)
✔ only repeated successful, unchanged and explicitly quiet observations back off, capped at 5s (1.662589ms)
✔ activity, uncertain state, failed reads and changed or missing fingerprints restore base cadence (0.278036ms)
✔ session/mode switches and forced input refresh bypass an idle deadline and reset history (0.512222ms)
✔ interval configuration stays finite, respects a lower cap, and preserves a slower configured base (0.824873ms)
✔ within-file yielding preserves tree, ledger, saved bytes, unicode and partial-record resume (373.191092ms)
✔ an append during a yield is deferred to the next observed snapshot (119.259307ms)
✔ replacement while scanning is rejected without publishing a mixed ledger and recovers on next collection (113.933176ms)
✔ in-place truncation during a yield discards the staged scan and retries from the new source (123.790612ms)
✔ a same-sized rewrite after listing is rejected before mixing source versions (171.343819ms)
✔ a same-inode truncate-and-regrow past the snapshot during yielding cannot publish mixed generations (227.831926ms)
✔ growth between metadata peek and scan still accepts an unchanged snapshot prefix (188.421961ms)
✔ larger same-inode regeneration before scanning cannot combine stale metadata with new events (196.33591ms)
✔ a second write during cooperative prefix verification is uncertain and retries from a fresh listing (136.214257ms)
✔ the last token report wins, even when the file starts with an older one (11.679965ms)
✔ what the agent spent in all is the newest cumulative report, with no summing (86.763886ms)
✔ a report past the first 256 KB is still found, because the tail is what is read (15.251251ms)
✔ a quiet tail grows the window once, and only once (24.596907ms)
✔ a rollout with no usable report reads as absent rather than empty (8.620007ms)
✔ a still rollout is answered from the cache, and an appended one is re-read (4.383446ms)
✔ one count for every view: the agents the main session started, their subtasks at any depth, the reviews wherever they sit (1.924475ms)
✔ the title row, the status card, the bar, notifications and the snapshot say the same of one session (34.149928ms)
✔ short of room, the title row gives up the name, the words, where its rows are, then the subtasks, each back where what it made room for does not fit (27.210524ms)
✔ in the tabs layout too, and on the settings page, the title takes a shorter form rather than cut one (215.496413ms)
✔ the alerts and the title row in Chinese (3.389309ms)
✔ observed entries come from the rollout times only; no time, no entry (1.702384ms)
✔ the log only grows: the same state again adds nothing, a new turn adds a start, and it is bounded (0.993096ms)
✔ the log is saved per session, 0600, and read back by the next panel (50.87892ms)
✔ the same note said again moves the one already there up to now instead of adding a copy (3.746081ms)
✔ what a model wrote is shown in the language it was written in; observed entries in any, an old entry by its text (0.602801ms)
✔ a note may name what the agent is on: the newest name in the language is its label, with its kind (0.745666ms)
✔ stored model summaries survive hidden observed logs, with explicit coverage metadata only (0.338279ms)
✔ an agent's rollout gives its rate as the main session's is taken, reading only what was appended (36.68864ms)
✔ a rate stands while the agent works this turn and its newest report is recent (0.875537ms)
✔ a card at work: a live subtask on one line, its rate beside the clock; the summary adds every running agent's (20.164285ms)
