✔ the Inspector says what an agent spent in all; narrow, the cache share goes, then the output (1.317628ms)
✔ a working card keeps only its newest model note; the tool line stays (16.253924ms)
✔ public assistant updates and replies retain exact words, not inferred progress (1.945014ms)
✔ public event messages are accepted, tools/token/plan events are not reports (0.322309ms)
✔ reasoning, user text, private and unknown channels never leak into reports (0.607949ms)
✔ malformed or undated messages do not invent freshness (0.313593ms)
✔ retained excerpts are bounded by code points without splitting Unicode (0.578886ms)
✔ message records do not create status, progress, success or file ownership (0.201624ms)
✔ a stage is who asked, what the agent said it would do, and what it returned (2.988393ms)
