✔ wall proxy includes initial latency and stalls, excluding the union of parallel tool waits (1.792681ms)
✔ unclosed waits conservatively remain in wall time; duplicate starts and unmatched results do not corrupt timing (0.211743ms)
✔ a missing tool result never freezes the denominator or inflates later output (0.216432ms)
✔ a tail without a prior counter waits for an actual delta instead of counting previous-turn output (0.653634ms)
✔ counter-only fallback discards tool waits before its first baseline (0.299346ms)
✔ clones isolate in-flight tools, turn state and counters during transactional parser reads (0.309194ms)
✔ invalid/backwards tool times and a zero model-time denominator cannot produce infinite rates (0.251016ms)
✔ main and agent readers use the same wall proxy across incremental reads, tool formats, replay and rotation (30.045531ms)
✔ CJK and emoji count as two columns, combining marks as zero (0.875838ms)
✔ truncation never exceeds the budget, even mid wide character (5.143764ms)
✔ truncation closes the colour it opened (0.282615ms)
✔ padding reaches the requested column count (0.384004ms)
✔ event history retains transitions through polling and clears on session switch (2.073222ms)
✔ Escape before a prefix command or another Escape preserves both inputs (2.229694ms)
